  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building for Women in the Northern Regions on Agro-Pastoral Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to reduce poverty and create jobs among women in the three northern regions of Cameroon (Adamawa, North and Far-North) by improving their proficiency in modern livestock breeding techniques to increase their financial independence and entrepreneurial capacity. The project will also build the capacity of women leaders in community conflict management and prevention, and in recognizing the signs of radicalization.</narrative>
  </description>
